OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsunny spells at first. However, cloud
OL,7,Fand rain already affecting Northern
OL,8,FIreland will move eastwards during the
OL,9,Fday, though southeastern areas will
OL,10,Fstay mostly dry. Windy, with coastal
OL,11,Fgales in the northwest. Temperatures
OL,12,Fnear average.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy across many central
OL,15,Fand southern areas with outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain or drizzle at times. Clear spells
OL,17,Ffollowing across many northern areas,
OL,18,Fwith blustery showers in the far
OL,19,Fnorthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
