OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FCloud and patchy rain or
OL,6,Fdrizzle linger across southern England
OL,7,Fand Wales, though brighter in the
OL,8,Feast. Elsewhere, sunny spells and
OL,9,Fblustery showers. Windy across
OL,10,Fnorthern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
